# Where leads are stored. Read at build time, so set it before `npm run build`.
#
#   (empty)   In this browser only (localStorage), with sample leads. No sign-in.
#   /api      The Express server in server/. In development, `npm run dev` forwards /api to it;
#             in production, the Express server serves this app and the API from one domain.
#   https://api.example.com/api
#             An API on another domain. Add this app's origin to CORS_ORIGINS on the server
#             and read "Connecting the frontend" in server/README.md first.
VITE_API_URL=
